+puts "============"
+puts ""
+
+# A ball of the radius of the fillet of the root (1) stays still in it,
+# touching the wall at one point: the walking can not be approximated there.
+# That part of the fillet is the sphere of the ball, as SolidWorks makes it
+# (center (-6.3705, 1, 41.7026)), with its pole at the point on the wall,
+# between the fillets of the two flanks.
+restore [locate_data_file freecad_screw_wall_profile_crest2.brep] b
+explode b E
+
+blend result b 1 b_95
+
+checkshape result
+checkmaxtol result -ref 1.83e-4
+checkprops result -v 8684.69 -s 2997.19
